  id: location_sweet_home
  displayName: Sweet Home
  description: 'A warm, peaceful, fairy-tale-like autumn atmosphere in the late afternoon.
    The sun is still above the horizon but is already descending toward it, bathing
    the landscape in

    soft golden light. A gentle autumn breeze softly carries
    the fallen leaves. The beautiful landscape, filled with warm sunlight, creates
    a feeling of peace, safety, and family comfort.'
